        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Parental leave is available to unit members and shall be granted in the order of sick leave with pay and sick leave without pay. All parental leave shall be granted in accordance with the Family Medical Leave Act under 16.4(e). Conditions of Use of Sick Leave.",
